{"version":1,"content":"<p>根據美國德州Starbase市政府網站發佈的聽證會通知，馬斯克旗下的SpaceX計劃在公司所在地Starbase建設、擁有並運營一座燃氣電廠和超級計算設施。項目初期預計投資240億美元。Starbase市政委員將在12月9日的會議上審議一項税收減免和開發協議。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585674.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.295416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T22:59:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"b5d7e6ccbd3286dc772039b5dc45e1aa59cfae30327061a2aa3969a318e22432","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}